{
	"info": {
		"name": "Accesorios Chic - E-Commerce API",
		"description": "Coleccion completa de endpoints del e-commerce de accesorios femeninos.\n\nTodos los endpoints pasan por el API Gateway en localhost:9000.\n\nSEGURIDAD: El sistema usa JWT Bearer tokens. Los endpoints de carrito/orden/pago (POST) funcionan SIN token (guest checkout); los historiales (GET /user/...) exigen token y solo devuelven datos propios; product/inventory requiren ADMIN o SELLER; analytics solo ADMIN.\n\nCredenciales seed:\n- ADMIN: cdcc@accesorioschic.cl / chete132\n- CUSTOMER: cliente1@accesorioschic.cl / 123456\n\nPaso 1: Ejecutar Register o Login para obtener el JWT token (se guarda en la variable environment {token} y userId = email).\nPaso 2: Usar los endpoints de cada servicio en orden logico.\nPaso 3: La carpeta 'Guest Checkout' prueba la compra sin token (invitado).\nPaso 4: La carpeta 'Admin/SELLER' prueba la gestion protegida por roles (usa el login de ADMIN).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:9000",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Maria\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@chic.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
						}
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.datos && json.datos.token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set('token', json.datos.token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userId', json.datos.email);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userName', json.datos.nombre);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userRol', json.datos.rol);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente1@accesorioschic.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
						}
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.datos && json.datos.token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set('token', json.datos.token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userId', json.datos.email);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userName', json.datos.nombre);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login (Admin)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cdcc@accesorioschic.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"chete132\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
						}
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.datos && json.datos.token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set('token', json.datos.token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userId', json.datos.email);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userName', json.datos.nombre);",
									"    pm.environment.set('userRol', json.datos.rol);",
									"    console.log('Login ADMIN OK. Rol: ' + json.datos.rol);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Admin/SELLER Register (solo ADMIN)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Nuevo Vendedor\",\n  \"email\": \"vendedor.ep1@accesorioschic.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"rol\": \"SELLER\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/register",
